-volume_16x9.jpg","Why can't big organisms rely on diffusion alone?","images/lesson-thumbs/gcse-bio-sa-volume_16x9.jpg"],"ecosystems-material-cycles":["gcse-hooks/posters/gcse-bio-predator-prey_16x9.jpg","Why do predator and prey numbers cycle?","images/lesson-thumbs/gcse-bio-predator-prey_16x9.jpg"]}}